    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37968" root="لمج" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمَاجٌ</span></b>  The <i>least</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْنَى</span>) [<i>kind,</i> or <i>quantity,</i>] <i>of
food,</i> or <i>of what is eaten:</i> (S, K:) and sometimes, <i>of beverage.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا تَلَمَّجْتُ عِنْدَهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِلَمَاجٍ</span>, (S, L,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمُوجٍ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُمْجَةٍ</span></b> , (L,) <i>I
ate not anything at his abode:</i> (L:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا ذُقْتُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمَاجاً وَلَا لَمَاجًا</span>, (S, L,) <i>I tasted not anything.</i>
(S, L.)

